<title>UK: UK meals/feeds little changed, trade quiet.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds little changed, trade quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds prices were mostly unchanged on Tuesday despite the lower close in Chicago on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Most people could see a higher Chicago opening coming on Tuesday and saw little point in moving prices,&quot; said a trader.</p>
<p>Others said they felt the influence of the weather market in Chicago was waning and most players were now going to stay sidelined.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8062</p>
</text>
